---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="HostDare Review - VPSTier.com" description="HostDare offers budget VPS with KVM virtualization starting at $4.49/mo. Known for China-optimized routes and reliable US West coast datacenters.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/vps" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-orange-500 text-sm mb-6 block">← Back to VPS Reviews</a>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-start justify-between mb-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">HostDare Review</h1>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
          <span>Commission: <strong class="text-orange-500">$15-50/sale</strong></span>
          <span>Cookie: <strong>90 days</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://bill.hostdare.com/aff.php?aff=4307" target="_blank" rel="noopener" 
         class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit HostDare →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">3.7/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">HostDare is a budget VPS provider known for its China-optimized network routes and reliable US West Coast datacenters. Popular among developers for stable performance at competitive prices.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $4.49/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Key Features</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">China-Optimized</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Special routing for low-latency China access via CN2 or Premium BGP.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">US West Coast</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Los Angeles and Seattle datacenters for strong Asia-Pacific connectivity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">KVM Virtualization</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Full KVM isolation with dedicated CPU and RAM allocations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Full Root Access</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Complete server control with SSH/API access on all plans.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Weekly Backups</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Automated weekly backups with optional paid restore service.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">PayPal Support</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Multiple payment methods including PayPal for convenient checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ China-optimized routing (CN2/Premium BGP)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Budget-friendly pricing from $4.49/mo</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Strong US West Coast datacenter locations</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Full root access and KVM on all plans</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ PayPal payment supported</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No control panel (SOLUSVM/OpenStack)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Support can be slower during peak</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Limited datacenter options outside US</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU or Windows options</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
      <a href="https://bill.hostdare.com/aff.php?aff=4307" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block text-center bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold transition">
        Sign Up via Our Affiliate Link
      </a>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        We earn a commission when you sign up through our link. This doesn't affect our review.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
